      scenario: 'The full app in one playground: dashboard, list with filters, add/edit form with validation, detail page, settings, 404, leave guard, transitions and localStorage. The playground only has the Vue global build, so it includes a ~40-line router (hash-free, in-memory) and a store built with reactive() that mirror Vue Router and Pinia; the next example shows the real files.',
